  "summary": "ahadiff serve creates local state and opens a WebUI at http://127.0.0.1:8765, with a --no-browser option; ordinary folders work while init and doctor target Git repositories. The WebUI supports five learning sources: Git changes, two files, a pasted diff, a saved snapshot, or a single Markdown document, with local preview before a generation request.",
